{"ex-203-1":{"id":"ex-203-1","chapter":"203","number":1,"title":"繪畫隔離體圖","question":"<p>繪畫以下各物體的隔離體圖。</p><p>(a) 自由下落的球 (b) 被推向左方的箱子</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a0e4594f3a30606ea20bcef7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:430.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/7e1dca67bccc387cf98365bb.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:453.9px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,454.3429833984375,560.2833009033203,640.2801666259766],"text":"例 題 1 繪畫隔離體圖\r\n繪畫以下各物體的隔離體圖。\r\n(a) 自由下落的球 (b) 被推向左方的箱子\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,640.2801666259766,560.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) \r\n重量\r\n(b) \r\n重量\r\n推力\r\n摩擦力\r\n法向力\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-2":{"id":"ex-203-2","chapter":"203","number":2,"title":"升降機的乘客","question":"<p>升降機載着一名乘客，以恆速度向下移動。</p><p>(a) 列出作用於乘客的力。</p><p>(b) 有淨力作用於乘客嗎？試解釋你的答案。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5caeb30b0000caf19241ee88.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:188.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 重量、升降機地板施加的法向力</p><p>(b) 由於乘客和升降機一起以恆速度移動，根據牛頓運動第一定律，沒有淨力作用於他。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":14,"kind":"question","box":[182.9323009033203,470.3509833984375,559.9323009033203,650.6670684814453],"text":"例題 2 升降機的乘客\r\n升降機載着一名乘客，以恆速度向下移動。\r\n(a) 列出作用於乘客的力。\r\n(b) 有淨力作用於乘客嗎？試解釋你的答案。\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[182.9323009033203,650.6670684814453,559.9323009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 重量、升降機地板施加的法向力\r\n(b) 由於乘客和升降機一起以恆速度移動，根據牛頓運動第一定律，\r\n沒有淨力作用於他。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-3":{"id":"ex-203-3","chapter":"203","number":3,"title":"冰上曲棍球的加速度","question":"<p>家朗以 100 N 的水平力把冰上曲棍球向右擊出。球的質量是0.17 kg，作用於它的摩擦力可略去不計。找出球的加速度。</p><p>冰上曲棍球</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/81ef7e0abdd1ed2a1e905118.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:250.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>本例題的解題流程圖：</p><p>畫出自由體圖</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/8108df797de742694ad5743d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:113.5px\"></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = 100 N（向右）</p><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 588 m s<sup>−2</sup>（向右）</p><p>把作用於物體的所有力與淨力聯繫起來，求 F<sub>net</sub></p><p>應用 F<sub>net</sub> = ma 求 a</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>F<sub>net</sub> 沿運動方向作用。應用下式時，只需考慮沿該方向作用的力：</p><p>F<sub>net</sub> = ma。重力和正向反作用力互相抵消。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,270.63798339843754,565.2833009033203,507.95445251464844],"text":"例 題 3 冰上曲棍球的加速度\r\n家朗以 100 N 的水平力把冰上\r\n曲棍球向右擊出。球的質量是\r\n0.17 kg，作用於它的摩擦力可\r\n略去不計。找出球的加速度。\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,507.95445251464844,565.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n \r\n100 N\r\n重量\r\n法向力\r\nFnet = 100 N （向右）\r\n根據 Fnet = ma，\r\na = Fnet\r\nm = 100\r\n0.17\r\n = 588 m s–2（向右）\r\n解題流程圖：\r\n繪畫隔離體圖\r\n找出所有作用於物體的\r\n力與淨力的關係，從而\r\n找出 Fnet\r\n應用 Fnet = ma\r\n來找出 a\r\n冰上曲棍球\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"tips","box":[40,266.63798339843754,184.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"提提你\r\nFnet 指向物體的移動方向。\r\n應用 Fnet = ma 時，只須考\r\n慮沿這個方向作用的力。\r\n重量與法向力會互相抵銷。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-4":{"id":"ex-203-4","chapter":"203","number":4,"title":"滑 水","question":"<p>雅雯被水平繩索拉動，沿直線向左加速。已知她的質量是 55 kg，繩索的張力是 210 N，水和空氣施於她的阻力是 100 N。她在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 時速度是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(a) 求雅雯的加速度。</p><p>(b) 從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1 s，雅雯移動了6 m。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 雅雯突然放開繩索。求她剛放手後的加速度。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/376603bfd4997eb4d3283953.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:208.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 和 (b) 的解題流程圖：</p><p>畫出自由體圖</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/5edd211153d0e0c0d66dc266.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:289.7px\"></p><p>把作用於物體的所有力與淨力聯繫起來，求 F<sub>net</sub>。取向左為正方向。</p><p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + (−<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> ) = 210 + (−100) = 110 N</p><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，</p><p>應用 F<sub>net</sub> = ma 求 a</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 2 m s<sup>−2</sup></p><p>Susan 的加速度為 2 m s<sup>−2</sup>（向左）。</p><p>(b) 由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>，</p><p>應用運動方程求 u</p><p>6 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> × 1 + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> × 2 × 1<sup>2</sup></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 5 m s<sup>−1</sup></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 為 5 m s<sup>−1</sup>（向左）。</p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = −<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = −100 N</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = −1.82 m s<sup>−2</sup></p><p>Susan 的加速度為 1.82 m s<sup>−2</sup>（向右）。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>F<sub>net</sub> 沿 Susan 的運動方向作用。應用下式時，只需考慮沿該方向作用的力：</p><p>F<sub>net</sub> = ma。注意 T 和 f 代表力的量值；若某力指向負方向，須加上負號。</p><p>提示</p><p>Susan 放開繩子後，張力不再作用於她身上，阻力便成為作用於她的合力。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":22,"kind":"question","box":[183.4833009033203,56.333983398437454,560.4833009033202,268.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 4 滑 水\r\n雅雯被水平繩索拉動，沿直線向左加\r\n速。已知她的質量是 55 kg，繩索的\r\n張力是 210 N，水和空氣施於她的阻\r\n力是 100 N。她在 t = 0 時速度是 u。\r\n(a) 求雅雯的加速度。\r\n(b) 從 t = 0 至 t = 1 s，雅 雯 移 動 了\r\n6 m。求 u。\r\n(c) 雅雯突然放開繩索。求她剛放手後的加速度。\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"answer","box":[183.4833009033203,268.6500701904297,560.4833009033202,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n法向力 R\r\n阻力 f\r\n重量 W\r\n張力 T\r\n取向左為正。\r\n(a) Fnet = T + (–f) = 210 + (–100) = 110 N\r\n根據 Fnet = ma，\r\na = Fnet\r\nm = 110\r\n55 = 2 m s–2\r\n雅雯的加速度是 2 m s–2（向左）。\r\n(b) 根據 s = ut + \r\n1\r\n2 at2\r\n，\r\n6 = u × 1 + 1\r\n2\r\n× 2 × 12\r\nu = 5 m s–1\r\nu 是 5 m s–1（向左）。\r\n(c) Fnet = –f = –100 N\r\na = Fnet\r\nm = –100\r\n55 = –1.82 m s–2\r\n雅雯的加速度是 1.82 m s–2（向右）。\r\n(a) 和 (b) 部的解題流程圖：\r\n繪畫隔離體圖\r\n找出所有作用於物體的\r\n力與淨力的關係，從而\r\n找出 Fnet\r\n應用Fnet = ma\r\n來找出 a\r\n應用運動方程來\r\n找出 u\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,179.4833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"提提你\r\nFnet 指向雅雯的移動方向。\r\n應用 Fnet = ma 時，只須考\r\n慮沿這個方向作用的力。T\r\n和 f 只代表力的量值；如果\r\n力指向負方向，須在量值前\r\n加上負號。\r\n提提你\r\n雅雯放手後，作用於她的張\r\n力消失，阻力變成作用於她\r\n的淨力。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-5":{"id":"ex-203-5","chapter":"203","number":5,"title":"太空人在月球的重量","question":"<p>太空人的質量是 80 kg，他在月球的重量是在地球時的六分之一。</p><p>(a) 求他在地球和月球的重量。</p><p>(b) 求月球的重力加速度 g<sub>M</sub>。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 在地球的重量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 80 × 9.81 = 785 N</p><p>在月球的重量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 785 = 131 N</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{W_{M}}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>131</mn><mn>80</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{131}{80}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.64 m s<sup>–2</sup></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[189.5333009033203,56.502983398437436,566.5333009033203,179.8193817138672],"text":"例 題 5 太空人在月球的重量\r\n太空人的質量是 80 kg，他在月球的重量是在地球時的六分之一。\r\n(a) 求他在地球和月球的重量。\r\n(b) 求月球的重力加速度 gM。\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[189.5333009033203,179.8193817138672,566.5333009033203,299.03098339843746],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 在地球的重量 WE = mg = 80 × 9.81 = 785 N\r\n在月球的重量 WM = 1\r\n6\r\n× WE = 1\r\n6 × 785 = 131 N\r\n(b) gM = WM\r\nm = 131\r\n80 = 1.64 m s–2\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-6":{"id":"ex-203-6","chapter":"203","number":6,"title":"吊台上的工人","question":"<p>質量為 60 kg 的工人站在吊台上（圖 a），圖 b 顯示他的隔離體圖。</p><p>圖 a 圖 b</p><p>(a) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的量值，並寫出力 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的名稱。</p><p>(b) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在下列情況中的量值。</p><p>(i) 吊台以恆速度向上升</p><p>(ii) 吊台以 0.2 m s<sup>–2</sup> 的加速度上升</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/7598ba3bfc63b294c64c77d7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:469.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 60 × 9.81 = 589 N</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是吊台施加的法向力。</p><p>(b) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 589 N</p><p>(ii) 取向上為正。根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> + (–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span>) = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> − 589 = 60 × 1.2</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 661 N</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>物體作勻速運動時，合力為零。</p><p>編輯核對</p><p>編輯核對：上方保留原印刷版解答。(b)(ii) 所述加速度為 0.2 m s<sup>-2</sup>，但原解答代入了 1.2 m s<sup>-2</sup>。按題目給定的加速度計算，A = 60(9.81 + 0.2) = 601 N。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[189.5333009033203,315.09298339843747,566.5333009033203,583.9300689697266],"text":"例 題 6 吊台上的工人\r\n質量為 60 kg 的工人站在吊台上（圖 a），圖 b 顯示他的隔離體圖。\r\n圖 a\r\nA\r\n圖 b 重量 W\r\n(a) 求 W 的量值，並寫出力 A 的名稱。\r\n(b) 求 A 在下列情況中的量值。\r\n (i) 吊台以恆速度向上升\r\n (ii) 吊台以 0.2 m s–2 的加速度上升\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[189.5333009033203,583.9300689697266,566.5333009033203,761.4669833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) W = mg = 60 × 9.81 = 589 N\r\nA 是吊台施加的法向力。\r\n(b) (i) A = W = 589 N\r\n (ii) 取向上為正。根據 Fnet = ma，\r\n A + (–W) = ma\r\n A − 589 = 60 × 1.2\r\n A = 661 N\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"tips","box":[40,311.09298339843747,185.5333009033203,761.4669833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n物體作勻速運動時淨力為\r\n零。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-7":{"id":"ex-203-7","chapter":"203","number":7,"title":"在升降機內感受到的重量","question":"<p>某高樓的升降機內有一個磅，以單位牛頓校準。</p><p>一名乘客站在磅上，升降機靜止時，磅的讀數是500 N。然後，升降機在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 從靜止開始上升，用了 37 s 從 5 樓到達 89 樓。磅的讀數變化如右圖所示。</p><p>求升降機在 (a) 0–15 s、(b) 22–37 s 期間的加速度。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/8ad52790b8d3457d22f3be39.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:337.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>取向上為正。</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>W</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 50.97 kg</p><p>(a) 在 0−15 s 期間，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + (−<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>W</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> ) = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>557 + (−500) = 50.97<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/ad78af011f6ab337e9bb2f15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:87.0px\"></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 1.12 m s<sup>−2</sup></p><p>升降機在 0–15 s 期間的加速度為 1.12 m s<sup>−2</sup>（向上）。</p><p>(b) 在 22−37 s 期間，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + (−<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>W</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>) = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>443 + (−500) = 50.97<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = −1.12 m s<sup>−2</sup></p><p>升降機在 22–37 s 期間的加速度為 1.12 m s<sup>−2</sup>（向下）。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":31,"kind":"question","box":[54.83430090332031,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,245.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 7 在升降機內感受到的重量\r\n某高樓的升降機內有一個磅，以單位牛頓校準。\r\n一名乘客站在磅上，升降機靜止時，磅的讀數是\r\n500 N。然後，升降機在 t = 0 從靜止開始上升，\r\n用了 37 s 從 5 樓到達 89 樓。磅的讀數變化如右圖\r\n所示。\r\n求升降機在 (a) 0–15 s、(b) 22–37 s 期間的加速度。\r\n"},{"page":31,"kind":"answer","box":[54.83430090332031,245.6500701904297,565.2833009033203,501.1869833984375],"text":"題解\r\n取向上為正。\r\nm = W\r\ng = 500\r\n9.81 = 50.97 kg\r\n(a) Fnet = R + (–W ) = ma\r\n 557 + (–500) = 50.97a\r\n a = 1.12 m s–2\r\n升降機在 0–15 s 期間的加速度是 1.12 m s–2（向上）。\r\n(b) Fnet = R + (–W) = ma\r\n 443 + (–500) = 50.97a\r\n a = –1.12 m s–2\r\n升降機在 22–37 s 期間的加速度是 1.12 m s–2（向下）。\r\n557\r\n500\r\n443\r\n0\r\n15 22 37\r\n磅的讀數 / N\r\n時間 / s\r\nR\r\nW\r\n結果顯示，當乘升降機上升\r\n且加速度指向上方，人就會\r\n感到重量增加。\r\n結果顯示，當乘升降機上升\r\n且加速度指向下方，人就會\r\n感到重量減小。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-8":{"id":"ex-203-8","chapter":"203","number":8,"title":"毅力號着陸","question":"<p>毅力號是一部勘察火星的機械探測車。運送毅力號的太空船靠火星大氣層的流體阻力減慢，到達火星表面 11 km 的上空時，便打開降落傘。</p><p>(a) 假設在某一刻太空船以減速度 50 m s<sup>–2</sup> 垂直下落，它當時的質量和重量分別是 3890 kg 和 14 400 N。求作用於太空船的流體阻力。</p><p>(b) 降落傘打開後，作用於太空船的流體阻力怎樣隨時間改變？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f98f2edcae901ea929ffcb54.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:454.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 取向上為正。</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> + (–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span>) = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> + (–14 400) = 3890 × 50</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 209 000 N</p><p>(b) 流體阻力會減少，直至量值與太空船的重量相同，隨後流體阻力便保持恆定不變。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/81e46f4c4ee11d8475065ea9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:103.4px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":35,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,215.21798339843747,565.2833009033203,553.2302398681641],"text":"例 題 8 毅力號着陸\r\n毅力號是一部勘察火星的機械探測車。運送毅力號的太空船靠火星大氣\r\n層的流體阻力減慢，到達火星表面11 km 的上空時，便打開降落傘。\r\n(a) 假設在某一刻太空船以減速度 50 m s–2 垂直下落，它當時的質\r\n量和重量分別是 3890 kg 和 14 400 N。求作用於太空船的流體\r\n阻力。\r\n(b) 降落傘打開後，作用於太空船的流體阻力怎樣隨時間改變？\r\n"},{"page":35,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,553.2302398681641,565.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 取向上為正。\r\n根據 Fnet = ma，\r\n f + (–W) = ma\r\nf + (–14 400) = 3890 × 50\r\n f = 209 000 N\r\n(b) 流體阻力會減少，直至量值與太空船的重量相同，隨後流體阻力\r\n便保持恆定不變。\r\n流體阻力 f\r\n重量 W\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-9":{"id":"ex-203-9","chapter":"203","number":9,"title":"摩擦力與作用力","question":"<p>某 2 kg 箱子在粗糙水平面上靜止不動，一道水平力 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 把它拉向右（圖 a）。作用於箱子的摩擦力是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>圖 a</p><p>當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 1 N，箱子靜止不動；當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 10 N，箱子便以 3 m s<sup>–2</sup> 向右加速。</p><p>(a) 當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 1 N，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的量值是多少？</p><p>(b) 當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 10 N，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的量值是多少？</p><p>(c) 然後 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在短時間內由 10 N 不斷減弱至 0，期間箱子一直向右移動。</p><p>(i) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 時箱子的加速度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(ii) 草繪上述期間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> 對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的關係線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/9078eb02ea38e04590eff64c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:303.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>取向右為正。</p><p>(a) 由於箱子靜止不動，根據牛頓運動第一定律，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1 N</p><p>(b) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> + (–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> ) = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>10 − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2 × 3</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4 N</p><p>(c) (i) 當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0，箱子一直向右移動，∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4 N（向左） 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> + (–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> ) = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ma</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>0 + (–4) = 2<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> = –2 m s<sup>–2</sup> 圖 b 加速度是 2 m s<sup>–2</sup>（向左）。</p><p>(ii) 見圖 b。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/af338c8fb3ddfcddea808016.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:193.3px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>F + (−f) = ma</p><p>F + (−4) = 2a</p><p>a = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>F − 2</p><p>a 隨 F 線性變化。</p><p>當 F = 0 時，a = −2 m s<sup>−2</sup>。</p><p>當 F = 10 N 時，a = 3 m s<sup>−2</sup>。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":40,"kind":"question","box":[182.8833009033203,54.833983398437454,559.8833009033203,409.2605438232422],"text":"例 題 9 摩擦力與作用力\r\n某 2 kg 箱子在粗糙水平面上靜止不動，一道水平力 F 把它拉向右\r\n（圖 a）。作用於箱子的摩擦力是 f。\r\n圖 a\r\nF\r\nf\r\n粗糙水平面\r\n當 F 是 1 N，箱子靜止不動；當 F 是 10 N，箱子便以 3 m s–2 向右加\r\n速。\r\n(a) 當 F 是 1 N，f 的量值是多少？\r\n(b) 當 F 是 10 N，f 的量值是多少？\r\n(c) 然後 F 在短時間內由 10 N 不斷減弱至 0，期間箱子一直向右移\r\n動。\r\n (i) 求 F = 0 時箱子的加速度 a。\r\n (ii) 草繪上述期間 a 對 F 的關係線圖。\r\n"},{"page":40,"kind":"answer","box":[182.8833009033203,409.2605438232422,559.8833009033203,747.8339833984375],"text":"題解\r\n取向右為正。\r\n(a) 由於箱子靜止不動，根據牛頓運動第一定律，\r\nf = F = 1 N\r\n(b) 根據 Fnet = ma，\r\nF + (–f ) = ma\r\n 10 − f = 2 × 3\r\n f = 4 N\r\n(c) (i) 當 F = 0，箱子一直向右移動，\r\n ∴ f = 4 N（向左）\r\n 根據 Fnet = ma，\r\n F + (–f ) = ma\r\n 0 + (–4) = 2a\r\n a = –2 m s–2\r\n 加速度是 2 m s–2（向左）。\r\n (ii) 見圖 b。\r\nF / N\r\na / m s–2\r\n0\r\n4 10\r\n3\r\n–2\r\n圖 b\r\n"},{"page":40,"kind":"tips","box":[40,50.833983398437454,178.8833009033203,747.8339833984375],"text":"提提你\r\nF + (–f) = ma\r\nF + (–4) = 2a\r\na = 1\r\n2 F – 2\r\na 隨 F 作線性改變。\r\n當 F = 0，a = –2 m s–2\r\n當 F = 10 N，a = 3 m s–2\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-10":{"id":"ex-203-10","chapter":"203","number":10,"title":"火箭發射","question":"<p>解釋火箭怎樣靠向下噴射熱氣來發射升空。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/4f07ace153757e6feaeb8e75.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:307.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>火箭對氣體施力，把氣體向下推出。根據牛頓第三定律，氣體也對火箭施加一個量值相同、方向相反的力，把火箭向上推。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":43,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,413.2189833984375,565.2833009033203,664.2544708251953],"text":"例 題 10 火箭發射\r\n解釋火箭怎樣靠向下噴射熱氣來發射升空。\r\n熱氣向下噴出\r\n"},{"page":43,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,664.2544708251953,565.2833009033203,745.0979833984375],"text":"題解\r\n火箭對氣體施力，把氣體向下推出。根據牛頓第三定律，氣體也對火\r\n箭施加一個量值相同、方向相反的力，把火箭向上推。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-203-11":{"id":"ex-203-11","chapter":"203","number":11,"title":"推汽車","question":"<p>某人在推汽車，但它沒有移動。</p><p>(a) 如果人施於汽車的推力是作用力，哪個是反作用力？</p><p>(b) 解釋為甚麼汽車靜止不動。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/331f7319934145257cf24c0f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:220.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 汽車施於人的力</p><p>(b) 地面作用於汽車的摩擦力與人的推力互相抵銷，因此作用於汽車的淨力為零。根據牛頓第一定律，汽車保持靜止不動。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>分析汽車的運動時，應考慮作用於汽車的力。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/c99ba89c4b1e963900063233.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:188.6px\"></p>","think":"<p>Samuel 說，汽車靜止是因為男子對汽車的推力被 (a) 中的反作用力抵消。你是否同意？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>不同意。推力作用於汽車，反作用力則作用於男子。作用於不同物體的力不能在汽車的受力平衡中互相抵消。汽車保持靜止，是因為地面對汽車施加的靜摩擦力平衡了推力。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"97720e77f1539402032e2cb7862ef638fcd0deb69150676c56d6800303ac3854","segments":[{"page":44,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,423.4449833984375,560.2833009033203,568.7610626220703],"text":"例 題 11 推汽車\r\n某人在推汽車，但它沒有移動。\r\n(a) 如果人施於汽車的推力是作用力，哪\r\n個是反作用力？\r\n(b) 解釋為甚麼汽車靜止不動。\r\n"},{"page":44,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,568.7610626220703,560.2833009033203,670.2979833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 汽車施於人的力\r\n(b) 地面作用於汽車的摩擦力與人的推力互相抵銷，因此作用於汽車\r\n的淨力為零。根據牛頓第一定律，汽車保持靜止不動。\r\n"},{"page":44,"kind":"tips","box":[40,419.4449833984375,179.2833009033203,670.2979833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n分析汽車的運動時，應考慮\r\n作用於汽車的力。\r\n人施加的推力\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}